# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Sanity's CLI loads .env.local automatically;
# it is gitignored, so the real values never reach the repository.
#
# Both come from the project you create at sanity.io/manage. Create the
# dataset in the EU region: these documents hold the personal data of largely
# EU residents, Sanity's default region is the US, and the region is fixed at
# creation — changing it later means exporting everything into a new project.

SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID=
SANITY_STUDIO_DATASET=production
